o }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AN}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=a,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{AN}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OAQ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AQ} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OQ} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OQ} \\\\  & =-a+q \\\\  & =q-a.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $AN:NQ=12:7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{AN}=\\frac{12}{19}\\overset{\\to }{AQ}=\\frac{12}{19}(q-a).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{ON} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AN} \\\\  & =a+\\frac{12}{19}(q-a) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{19}a+\\frac{12}{19}q.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322268 13194139534953 true] [17592186322267 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322269 13194139534953 true] [17592186322267 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534953 true] [17592186322267 1041 "field-1" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322267 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322269 13194139534953 true] [17592186322267 1110 #uuid "299eb5dc-e3f9-5f8f-b946-215414ec3411" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322268 1034 "\\frac{12}{19}" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322268 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534953 true] [17592186322268 1111 #uuid "04c500b4-bc8b-5a8e-a4f4-7be16f0e4ead" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322269 1034 "\\frac{7}{19}" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322269 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534953 true] [17592186322269 1111 #uuid "b24344f3-e43f-5877-8c52-00d67f759ded" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322270 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322271 13194139534953 true] [17592186322270 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534953 true] [17592186322270 1041 "field-2" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322270 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322271 13194139534953 true] [17592186322270 1110 #uuid "381b66d8-b918-566b-bab4-e79f6eb429f5" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322271 1034 "\\frac{12}{19}" 13194139534953 true] [17592186322271 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534953 true] [17592186322271 1111 #uuid "2